      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Tunku Abdul Rahman Foundation Fund (Amendment) Bill 2025"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/1/eng@/~cl_1",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/1/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/1/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/1/eng@"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/1/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/1/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act may be cited as the Tunku Abdul Rahman Foundation Fund (Amendment) Act 2025."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/1/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/1/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act comes into operation on a date to be appointed by the Minister by notification in the Gazette. Amendment of section 2"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/1/eng@/~cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/1/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Tunku Abdul Rahman Foundation Fund Act 1966 [Act 389], which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Act, is amended in section 2 by substituting for the definition of “Minister” the following definition: ‘ “Minister” means the Minister charged with the responsibility for the Tunku Abdul Rahman Foundation Fund.’. Amendment of section 5"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/1/eng@/~cl_3",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/1/eng@/~cl_3__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/1/eng@/~cl_3__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/1/eng@/~cl_3__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/1/eng@/~cl_3__para_d"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/1/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 5 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/1/eng@/~cl_3__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/1/eng@/~cl_3__para_a__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/1/eng@/~cl_3__para_a__subpara_ii",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/1/eng@/~cl_3__para_a__subpara_iii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/1/eng@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (1)—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/1/eng@/~cl_3__para_a__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/1/eng@/~cl_3__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph (a), by inserting after the words “Yang di-Pertuan Agong” the words “, on the advice of the Minister”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/1/eng@/~cl_3__para_a__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/1/eng@/~cl_3__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph (b), by substituting for the words “Ministry of Higher Education” the words “Ministry charged with the responsibility for the Fund”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/1/eng@/~cl_3__para_a__subpara_iii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "iii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/1/eng@/~cl_3__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph (d), by inserting after the word “Minister” the words “after consultation with the Chairman”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/1/eng@/~cl_3__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/1/eng@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (1) the following subsection: “(1a) The Chairman and members of the Board under paragraph (1)(d) shall be from amongst persons of standing, achievement and experience in the charity or human capital development field or from amongst professionals who possess relevant experience in educational, financial or commercial matters.”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/1/eng@/~cl_3__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/1/eng@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (2), by substituting for the words “three years” the words “four years”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/1/eng@/~cl_3__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/1/eng@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for subsection (3) the following subsection: “(3) The Chairman shall preside at all meetings of the Board and in his absence from any meeting, such other member of the Board as may be elected by the members of the Board who are present shall preside as Chairman and have all the powers of the Chairman.”. New section 7a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/1/eng@/~cl_4",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/1/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended in Part IV, by inserting before section 8 the following section: “Objects of the Fund 7a. The objects for which monies of the Fund may be applied are as follows: (a) to perpetuate the good name, legacy and aspirations of Yang Teramat Mulia Tunku Abdul Rahman Putra Al-Haj; (b) to uplift and empower individuals from underprivileged backgrounds to access and pursue higher education; (c) to strengthen Malaysia’s human capital in order to serve and contribute to the development and the progress of the nation; and (d) to promote national unity and to spread the principles of the Rukun Negara.”. Amendment of section 8"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/1/eng@/~cl_5",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/1/eng@/~cl_5__para_a",
